Error [E0358]: `DbError` is spelled `DBError`
  --> tests/ui/retired_acronym_derived_signature.jet:3:6
    |
  3 | enum DbError {
    |      ^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet keeps acronyms fully capitalized inside PascalCase names (D-ACRO-CASE1=A, D-ACRO-LEX1=A)
 Fix: Write `DBError` instead of `DbError`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0358
